#: includes/class-form.php:104
msgid "When a visitor fills in a birth chart, Human Design, compatibility, moon sign, rising sign, Solar Return, Lunar Return or Davison chart form, the date, time and place they enter are sent to api.astroway.info to calculate the answer, and the city name to app.astroway.info to find its coordinates. Names typed into the compatibility form are not sent anywhere. The AstroWay plugin does not store any of it on this site: the answer is not cached and the page is sent with no-store. Security or activity-log plugins on this site may record form submissions on their own."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-form.php:105
msgid "When a visitor fills in the numerology form, the name and birth date they enter are sent from this site's server to api.astroway.info to calculate the numbers. The AstroWay plugin does not store them on this site."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-form.php:106
msgid "Tarot cards with pictures load those pictures in the visitor's browser from cdn.astroway.info, which therefore receives the visitor's IP address, as for any image from another site. When a spread asks for its reading, the drawn cards and the page's language are sent from this site's server to api.astroway.info; nothing about the visitor is sent with them, and the reading is kept on this site for a day so that the same spread is read once."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-form.php:119
msgid "Visitors do not see this calculator: it runs on the site key, so that their charts never spend your credits, and a site connected to an AstroWay account has no site key. The shortcode with the birth data written in still works. Only administrators see this note."
msgstr ""

